# %% [markdown]
# # Readme
# This notebook shows how your personal schema is loaded and how to populate it.
# It is generated by `make_project.py` and only contains the sections for the table blocks you selected: __BLOCKS__.
# It's also great to test how to add new tables and how this affects your pipeline.
#
